QEsWe LHlFs pf-24_"><b>About Penta Motor Group</b></span></h3><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-25_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px;--s-lg:20px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-26_"><p class="sc-kMriOJ cVLihF pf-27_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dQEsWe LHlFs pf-29_">Penta Motor Group: Born in 2011, we didn't just enter the automotive world, we roared onto the scene. Today, our 13 dealerships across Gauteng, Limpopo, and North West stand as testaments to our unwavering commitment: providing lasting solutions for your every vehicle need.<br><br>Our team isn't just experienced, they're automotive alchemists, transforming years of expertise into unparalleled customer service and product quality. We don't just offer cars, we craft journeys. From sleek city cruisers to rugged off-road beasts, we have the perfect vehicle to fuel your next adventure. And with our seamless financing options and comprehensive maintenance services, the road ahead is smooth sailing.<br><br>Ready to ditch the ordinary and drive extraordinary?</span></p></div></div><div class="pf-c pf-lg-hide pf-md-hide pf-sm-hide pf-hide" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:6;--c-md:6;--c-lg:6"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-30_ pf-lg-hide pf-md-hide pf-sm-hide pf-hide"><p class="sc-kMriOJ cVLihF pf-31_ pf-text-1" data-pf-type="Paragraph"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dQEsWe LHlFs pf-33_">With <b>over 20 years of experience</b> in the motor retail industry, the Dealer Principals and key role players leading the establishment of the Penta Motor Group, have prided themselves in achieving and exceeding excellent customer service through our team's personality, the quality of our products as well as our infrastructure. <br><br>Join the Penta Motor Group family today!</span></p></div></div></div><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-365_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style=