ass="sc-eZjPq gpuBwB pf-155_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dQEsWe LHlFs pf-157_">2013</span></h3></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-158_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-fBWQee fRIhhe pf-159_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-162_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-eZjPq gpuBwB pf-163_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dQEsWe LHlFs pf-165_">Suzuki Klerksdorp<span style="font-weight: normal;"> </span>opens<span style="font-weight: normal;"> their doors in May, shortly followed by </span>Renault Klerksdorp<span style="font-weight: normal;"> who delivers their first Clio.</span></span></h3></div></div></div><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-166_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-167_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-fBWQee fRIhhe pf-168_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-171_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-eZjPq gpuBwB pf-172_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dQEsWe LHlFs pf-174_">2014</span></h3></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-175_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-fBWQee fRIhhe pf-176_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-179_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-eZjPq gpuBwB pf-180_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dQEsWe LHlFs pf-182_"><span style="font-weight: normal;">Establishing our </span>Gauteng <span style="font-weight: normal;">footprint, </span>Suzuki &amp; Mahindra Montana opens<span style="font-weight: normal;"> with a bang in May, winning numerous awards up until the present day. </span>Mahindra Klerksdorp joins the group<span style="font-weight: normal;">, soon becoming an established household name within the Klerksdorp area.</span></span></h3></div></div></div><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-183_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-184_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-fBWQee fRIhhe pf-185_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-188_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-eZjPq gpuBwB pf-189_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dQEsWe LHlFs pf-191_">2015</span></h3></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-192_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-fBWQee fRIhhe pf-193_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-196_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-eZjPq gpuBwB pf-197_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dQEsWe LHlFs pf-199_">North West Motor Group family welcomes Nissan Standerton<span style="font-weight: normal;">, rapidly expanding their product range. Our group is recognised as one of the top 5 national brands.</span></span></h3></div></div></div><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-200_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-201_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-fBWQee fRIhhe pf-202_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-205_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-eZjPq gpuBwB pf-206_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dQEsWe LHlFs pf-208_">2016</span></h3></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-209_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-fBWQee fRIhhe pf-210_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-213_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-eZjPq gpuBwB pf-214_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dQEsWe LHlFs pf-216_"><span style="font-weight: normal;">In August, the </span>North West Motor Group becomes<span style="font-weight: normal;">&nbsp;the punchy-sounding </span>Penta Motor Group<span style="font-weight: normal;">. Founded by five partners, it's natural to use penta (Greek for five) as our new name.</span></span></h3></div></div></div><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-217_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-218_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-fBWQee fRIhhe pf-219_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-222_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-eZjPq gpuBwB pf-223_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dQEsWe LHlFs pf-225_">2017</span></h3></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-226_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-fBWQee fRIhhe pf-227_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-230_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-eZjPq gpuBwB pf-231_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dQEsWe LHlFs pf-233_">Suzuki Menlyn<span style="font-weight: normal;">, the newest kid on the block, </span>is acquired in February<span style="font-weight: normal;">. Suzuki's exposure within Pretoria and surrounds amplifies. The franchise recently broke Suzuki SA's sales record.</span></span></h3></div></div></div><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-234_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-235_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-fBWQee fRIhhe pf-236_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-239_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-eZjPq gpuBwB pf-240_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dQEsWe LHlFs pf-242_">2018</span></h3></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-243_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-fBWQee fRIhhe pf-244_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-247_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-eZjPq gpuBwB pf-248_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dQEsWe LHlFs pf-250_">Penta Motor Group welcomes our Limpopo branches<span style="font-weight: normal;">: </span>Mahindra Polokwane, Volvo Cars Polokwane, <span style="font-weight: normal;">and </span>Mahindra Mokopane<span style="font-weight: normal;">. </span>Penta Klerksdorp <span style="font-weight: normal;">builds bigger, better premises. The group's footprint expands significantly in the Northern provinces.</span></span></h3></div></div></div><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-251_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-252_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-fBWQee fRIhhe pf-253_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-256_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-eZjPq gpuBwB pf-257_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dQEsWe LHlFs pf-259_">2019</span></h3></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-260_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-fBWQee fRIhhe pf-261_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-264_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-eZjPq gpuBwB pf-265_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dQEsWe LHlFs pf-267_">Penta restuctures<span style="font-weight: normal;">, welcoming new regional directors and after-sales specialists. </span>Penta Klerksdorp<span style="font-weight: normal;"> makes headlines </span>selling one out of seven cars<span style="font-weight: normal;"> in their municipal district!</span></span></h3></div></div></div><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-268_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-269_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-fBWQee fRIhhe pf-270_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-273_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-eZjPq gpuBwB pf-274_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dQEsWe LHlFs pf-276_">2020</span></h3></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-277_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-fBWQee fRIhhe pf-278_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-281_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-eZjPq gpuBwB pf-282_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dQEsWe LHlFs pf-284_"><span style="font-weight: normal;">Covid-19 changes the course of history. During the lockdown, our in-house marketing team creates fresh, innovative ways that address mobility. We're excited for the future, lining up new projects to be launched. </span>Penta welcomes our North West branch: Hyundai Brits<span style="font-weight: normal;">.</span></span></h3></div></div></div><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-285_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-286_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-fBWQee fRIhhe pf-287_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-290_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-eZjPq gpuBwB pf-291_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dQEsWe LHlFs pf-293_">2021</span></h3></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-294_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-fBWQee fRIhhe pf-295_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-298_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-eZjPq gpuBwB pf-299_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dQEsWe LHlFs pf-301_">Penta ventures into the fleet and rental market<span style="font-weight: 400;">,</span> launching Drive<span style="font-weight: 400;"> and </span>Penta Fleet Solutions<span style="font-weight: 400;">. This year also holds some excitement with the </span>opening of our Chery floor <span style="font-weight: normal;">at</span> Penta Menlyn<span style="font-weight: 400;">. In addition, PMG officially </span><span style="font-weight: normal;">won</span> Suzuki's volume dealer of the year award 2020<span style="font-weight: 400;"> with </span>Suzuki Rustenburg<span style="font-weight: 400;"> being the overall dealer of the year.</span></span></h3></div></div></div><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-302_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-303_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-fBWQee fRIhhe pf-304_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-307_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-eZjPq gpuBwB pf-308_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dQEsWe LHlFs pf-310_">2022</span></h3></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-311_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-fBWQee fRIhhe pf-312_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-315_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-eZjPq gpuBwB pf-316_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dQEsWe LHlFs pf-318_"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Penta opens the <strong>PMG fitment centre</strong>, providing vehicle customisations to meet the unique needs of our clients. Additionally, we opened the doors to the <strong>Suzuki Experience Store</strong> in <strong>Menlyn Park Shopping Centre</strong>, allowing us to make it easier for our customers to access our products.<br></span></span></h3></div></div></div><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-319_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-320_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-fBWQee fRIhhe pf-321_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-324_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-eZjPq gpuBwB pf-325_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dQEsWe LHlFs pf-327_">2023</span></h3></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-328_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-fBWQee fRIhhe pf-329_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-332_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-eZjPq gpuBwB pf-333_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dQEsWe LHlFs pf-335_"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Penta adds another brand to our portfolio with <strong>Omoda</strong>, the luxury sub-brand of Chery. We also introduced the <strong>Jimny Crew</strong>, an organisation sharing appreciation for the Suzuki Jimny. In addition, Suzuki footprint grows with the <strong>opening of two new branches</strong> in <strong>Brits and Potchefstroom</strong>.<br></span></span></h3></div></div></div><div class="sc-jXbVAB kNtuek pf-336_ pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:0px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-337_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-fBWQee fRIhhe pf-338_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-341_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-eZjPq gpuBwB pf-342_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dQEsWe LHlFs pf-344_">2024</span></h3></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-345_"><div data-pf-type="Divider" class="sc-fBWQee fRIhhe pf-346_ pf-divider-1"></div></div></div><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-sm:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-lnPyOc gUmbDa pf-349_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-eZjPq gpuBwB pf-350_ pf-heading-1-h3"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-dQEsWe LHlFs pf-352_"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Jaecoo joins Omoda and we <strong>launch the first official Omoda | Jaecoo dealership</strong> in the country. 

To increase our footprint <strong>Penta Now kicks off</strong> with 7 dealerships in 3 provinces focussing on quality used vehicles.
